You want to catch when a service's traffic falls sharply and suddenly. Prometheus has request counts by service, so we can watch that.

Which service—or should I alert on all of them together?
I'll set up an alert that watches request rate on all four services in prod and fires the moment any drops by half within 10 minutes.
